"overview": "Senator Ed Markey seeks a third full term against Republican John Deaton, a crypto lawyer running as an anti-Trump Republican in a deeply blue state. Markey survived a high-profile primary challenge from Representative Seth Moulton, while Deaton's central obstacle, as local coverage notes, is President Trump's unpopularity in Massachusetts rather than Markey himself.\n\nPolling has been remarkably stable: every survey this cycle shows Markey ahead by 19 to 29 points, with the latest September polls at 22 and 26 points. Markey also holds a large fundraising edge, and all ten expert ratings and the major prediction markets agree the race is effectively decided. The main open question is the size of the margin, not the winner.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9975, "margin": 19.63}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.998, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9963, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9982, "margin": 20.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9978, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9987, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9983, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.998, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9983, "margin": 22.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9988, "margin": 22.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.999, "margin": 24.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9994, "margin": 24.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9989, "margin": 24.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9993, "margin": 24.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.999, "margin": 24.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9987, "margin": 23.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9992, "margin": 24.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9988, "margin": 24.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9988, "margin": 24.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9993, "margin": 24.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.999, "margin": 24.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.9986, "margi